QuestGuidance.Register("en",92,{
[2913]="7006B5F3\n1\tTalk to Silirtas outside Adakûr in Imhûlar\tSilirtas is outside Adakûr in Imhûlar.\n2\tFind your travelling companions somewhere in Imhûlar, perhaps in the city of Urmâkh\tFind your travelling companions in the village of Urmâkh, north-west of Adakûr.\n3\tTell your companions what befell you while you were apart\tYour companions within Urmâkh eagerly await the tale of your adventures.\n4\tTalk to Corudan within Urmâkh\030Talk to Sirgon within Urmâkh\tCorudan, Sirgon, and Rahâzi are within the city of Urmâkh.\n5\tTalk to Rahâzi within Urmâkh\tCorudan, Sirgon, and Rahâzi are within Urmâkh.\n6\tRahâzi challenged you to speak with residents of Urmâkh and learn their opinions of Gondor.\t\n7\tTalk to Sirgon within Urmâkh\tSirgon is within the city of Urmâkh.\n",
[2914]="700539EC\n1\tTalk to Glorfindel on Tol Send and complete 'Instance: The Glory of the Bright Company'\tGlorfindel is on Tol Send. He has agreed to finish the tale begun by the shade of Isildur, despite his misgivings.\n2\tTalk to Glorfindel on Tol Send\tGlorfindel is on Tol Send.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf on Tol Send\tGandalf is on Tol Send.\n",
[2915]="7006B5F7\n1\tCollect toad legs in Imhûlar (total: 4)\030Collect zizanu bristles in Imhûlar (total: 4)\030Collect scorpion stingers in Imhûlar (total: 4)\tSirgon has spoken with the people of Urmâkh and wants you to bring them, on behalf of Gondor, some of the ingredients for which they have asked.\n2\tBring the ingredients to Sharûkh within Urmâkh\tSharûkh is within Urmâkh, waiting for you to bring the ingredients Sirgon promised.\n3\tTalk to Rahâzi within Urmâkh\tRahâzi is within Urmâkh.\n4\tDefeat cultists in Imhûlar and the city of Kûr Anzar (total: 8)\tRahâzi wants you to defeat cultists throughout Imhûlar, especially in the occupied city of Kûr Anzar.\n5\tTalk to Irnamar within Urmâkh\tIrnamar is within Urmâkh.\n6\tTalk to Sirgon within Urmâkh\tSirgon is within Urmâkh.\n",
[2916]="700539EF\n1\tTalk to Elrond on Tol Send\tElrond is on Tol Send, and he wishes to pick up the tale where Gandalf has left it.\n",
[2917]="7006B5FB\n1\tMeet up with the rest of your travelling party in north-east Imhûlar, on the road into Urash Dâr\tThe rest of your travelling party should be in north-east Imhûlar, on the road into Urash Dâr.\n2\tTalk to Belondor at the road into Urash Dâr\tBelondor stands by the road that runs into Urash Dâr.\n3\tTell Belondor a careful version of what befell you since you parted in Ghalbûru\tBelondor is at the road into Urash Dâr, waiting to hear what befell you and Sigileth after you parted in Ghalbûru.\n4\tTalk to Khôltekh at the road into Urash Dâr\030Talk to Rothog at the road into Urash Dâr\tKhôltekh and Rothog listened to your story, and they have some thoughts of their own.\n5\tTalk to Belondor at the road into Urash Dâr\tBelondor stands by the road leading into Urash Dâr.\n6\tFind the abandoned town to the north-west in Urash Dâr\tA good location for a camp can be found to the north-west in Urash Dâr, at a town recently abandoned by its former occupants.\n7\tLight the camp-fire at the abandoned town in Urash Dâr\tYou have been charged with setting up camp at the abandoned town to the north-west in Urash Dâr.\n8\tWait for your companions to arrive\tYou have been charged with setting up camp at the abandoned town in Urash Dâr.\n9\tTalk to Silirtas at your new campsite in Urash Dâr\tSilirtas is at your new campsite in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2918]="7006B606\n1\tCross the river to the west and look in the direction of Maurûsh\tSilirtas wants you to cross the river to the west and look at the stone keep of Maurûsh.\n2\tCreep closer and listen for sounds from Maurûsh\tSilirtas wants you to creep closer and listen for what might be happening within Maurûsh.\n3\tTalk to Silirtas at your new campsite in Urash Dâr\tSilirtas is at your new campsite in Urash Dâr.\n4\tTalk to Sigileth at your campsite in Urash Dâr\tSigileth is at your campsite in Urash Dâr.\n5\tTalk to Silirtas at your campsite in Urash Dâr\tSilirtas is at your campsite in Urash Dâr.\n6\tTalk to Silirtas and go with her into Maurûsh\tSilirtas is at your campsite in Urash Dâr, preparing to go with you to Maurûsh.\n7\tTalk to Mithrandir at your campsite in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir has come to your campsite in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2919]="7006B675\n1\tFind Legolas and Gimli to the north-west of your campsite\030Find Glorfindel to the east of your campsite\030Find Elladan and Elrohir to the north-east of your campsite\030Talk to Legolas in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Gimli in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Glorfindel in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Elladan in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Elrohir in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir has sent you to recall the scouts he sent to the north-west and north-east of Urash Dâr.\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir at your campsite in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at your campsite in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2920]="7006B67A\n1\tHear what Mithrandir has to say about the Kintai\tMithrandir has much to say about a number of different subjects.\n2\tHear what Mithrandir has to say about the Elder Orcs\tMithrandir has much to say about a number of different subjects.\n3\tHear what Mithrandir has to say about the Thardúth\tMithrandir has much to say about a number of different subjects.\n4\tHear what Mithrandir has to say about the Grim Southron\tMithrandir has much to say about a number of different subjects.\n5\tHear what Mithrandir has to say about the Dark Lord Sauron\tMithrandir has much to say about a number of different subjects.\n6\tTalk to Mithrandir at your campsite in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at your campsite in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2921]="7001B5C6\n1\tDefeat an uruk-commander in Búrzkala\030Defeat an uruk-commander in Kúfuzg\030Defeat an uruk-commander in Hongoi\030Find plans of battle (total: 5)\tBúrzkala, Kúfuzg, and Hongoi are Orc-camps in the northern reaches of Gathbúrz. Ningloril has asked you to slay the uruk-commanders of the large camps in the north of Gathbúrz and to search the camps for plans of battle.\n2\tBring plans of battle to Ningloril\tNingloril is in Thangúlhad, the closest camp of the Golden Host to Dol Guldur. You have defeated the uruk-commanders in Búrzkala, Kúfuzg, and Hongoi and recovered some of their battle plans. Ningloril is waiting for your return.\n",
[2922]="70021E91\n1\tFind the fallen Man of Rohan along the road and try to save him\tThe former bearer of the Rohirrim sword may be close to death somewhere on the road south of the blockade in the Windfells. Saeradan wants you to search the road, starting at the blockaded north gate and working your way south, looking for the fallen Rohirrim.\n2\tTalk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan\tSaeradan is at his camp in the Windfells. You have found the former bearer of the sword, but he was not one of the Rohirrim at all. It was Wadu of the Uch-lûth, and when you arrived he was already dead. You should bring the news to Saeradan.\n",
[2923]="700115FD\n1\tTalk to Ráthwald and travel to face the Watcher\tRáthwald is at the ruined arch near Echad Dúnann, in Eregion. Now that you have a weapon strong enough to harm the Watcher in the Water, Ráthwald is waiting to bring you to Bósi.\n2\tTalk to Ráthwald\tRáthwald is at the ruined arch near Echad Dúnann, in Eregion. You have driven away the Watcher in the Water and the dwarves have entered Moria at last.\n",
[2924]="7006B67B\n1\tTalk to Glorfindel at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Khôltekh at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Rothog at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tSome of your companions at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr have begun to devise plans for combatting the Thardúth and the Elder Orcs that serve them.\n2\tDefeat Orcs throughout Urash Dâr (total: 10)\030Collect teeth from jackals in Urash Dâr (total: 6)\030Collect claws from crebain in Urash Dâr (total: 4)\030Sketch a map to Ashâgir on the parchment Khôltekh gave to you\030Find a good place at which to sketch Khôltekh a map to Ashâgir\tRothog asked you to defeat Orcs throughout Urash Dâr. Glorfindel asked you to collect jackal teeth and craban claws from creatures throughout Urash Dâr so he can examine them for unusual effects or signs of corruption. Khôltekh asked you to draw him a map to the ruins of Ashâgir in north-west Urash Dâr.\n3\tBring the teeth and claws to Glorfindel at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tGlorfindel is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n4\tTalk to Rothog at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tRothog is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n5\tBring the map you sketched to Khôltekh at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tKhôltekh is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n6\tTalk to Rahâzi at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tRahâzi is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2925]="700539EE\n1\tTalk to the shade of Isildur on Tol Send\tThe shade of Isildur is on Tol Send.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf on Tol Send\tGandalf is on Tol Send, deep in thought.\n3\tTalk to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús\tGrimbeorn is at the Beorninghús. Gandalf thinks you should return to the Beorninghús and speak with Grimbeorn.\n",
[2926]="700539F0\n1\tCollect firewood from the Beorning-lands (total: 4)\030Defeat Orcs in the Beorning-lands (total: 4)\030Defeat wargs in the Beorning-lands (total: 3)\tFirewood can be found near the base of trees in the Beorning-lands, and Orcs and wargs still threaten the peace of the Beornings.\n2\tBring the firewood to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús\tGrimbeorn is waiting for you at the Beorninghús.\n3\tGo to the Forest Gate on the edge of Eryn Lasgalen\tGrimbeorn has not heard from the Elves at the Forest Gate in some time, and despite his reticence to restart trade with the Elves, he worries about the silence.\n4\tTalk to Thindrif at the Forest Gate\tThindrif is at the Forest Gate.\n5\tThindrif invited you to search the corpses of the Orcs for some clue as to why they attempted to pass through the Forest Gate.\t\n6\tTalk to Thindrif at the Forest Gate\tThindrif is at the Forest Gate.\n7\tSearch the Beorning-lands for the missing Orc's hiding-place\tThindrif thinks one of the Orcs might have escaped into the Beorning-lands during the commotion.\n8\tRead the crumpled note you found on the missing Orc\tYou found a crumpled note clutched in the hand of the Orc that fled through the Forest Gate.\n9\tBring the crumpled note to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús\tGandalf is inside the Beorninghús.\n",
[2927]="7006B68F\n1\tWave to Rahâzi at Ilzag Khûl\tRahâzi is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n3\tTalk to Belondor at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tBelondor is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n4\tWave to Belondor at Ilzag Khûl\tBelondor is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n5\tTalk to Silirtas at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tSilirtas is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n6\tWave to Silirtas at Ilzag Khûl\tSilirtas is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n7\tTalk to Silirtas at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tSilirtas is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n8\tTalk to Sigileth at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tSigileth is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n9\tWave to Sigileth at Ilzag Khûl\tSigileth is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n10\tWait for the emissaries to depart\tThe emissaries have left on their missions.\n11\tTalk to Mithrandir at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2928]="7006B707\n1\tTalk to Corudan at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tCorudan is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n2\tTalk to Khôltekh at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tKhôltekh can be found at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr. Corudan is concerned about Khôltekh's apparent discovery of a cache of Narghâk, the Hungry Fire.\n3\tMeet with Khôltekh outside Ashâgir atop the north-west cliffs in Urash Dâr\tKhôltekh asked to meet you and Corudan outside Ashâgir, to the north-west in Urash Dâr.\n4\tTalk to Khôltekh outside Ashâgir in Urash Dâr\tKhôltekh stands outside Ashâgir, to the north-west in Urash Dâr.\n5\tTalk to Corudan outside Ashâgir in Urash Dâr\tCorudan stands outside Ashâgir, atop the north-west cliffs in Urash Dâr.\n6\tSearch the depths of Ashâgir for a hidden chamber containing the cache of Narghâk\tSomewhere inside the depths of Ashâgir, Khôltekh believes you will find a chamber containing a lost, hidden cache of Narghâk.\n7\tTalk to Corudan in the undisturbed chamber deep within Ashâgir\tCorudan stands within the undisturbed chamber deep within Ashâgir.\n8\tTalk to Khôltekh in the undisturbed chamber deep within Ashâgir\tKhôltekh stands within the undisturbed chamber deep within Ashâgir.\n",
[2929]="700539F1\n1\tTalk to Gandalf and complete 'Instance: The Picture Painted'\tGandalf is inside the Beorninghús, waiting to divulge what he has learned from his study of the Black Book of Mordor.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús\tGandalf is inside the Beorninghús, shaken by what he has learned from the Black Book of Mordor.\n",
[2930]="7006B70B\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n2\tMeet with Glorfindel to the north-east within the channel of the River Mûshid\tGlorfindel is to the north-east within the channel of the River Mûshid that runs through Urash Dâr. Mithrandir has sent much of your travelling company along the river to the north-east, where he believes the Thardúth dwell. He asked you to speak with them during the approach.\n3\tTalk to Glorfindel within the channel of the River Mûshid\tGlorfindel is to the north-east within the channel of the River Mûshid that runs through Urash Dâr. Mithrandir has sent much of your travelling company along the river to the north-east, where he believes the Thardúth dwell. He asked you to speak with them during the approach.\n4\tMeet with Legolas to the north within the channel of the River Mûshid\tLegolas is to the north within the channel of the River Mûshid that runs through Urash Dâr. Mithrandir has sent much of your travelling company along the river to the north-east, where he believes the Thardúth dwell. He asked you to speak with them during the approach.\n5\tTalk to Legolas to the north within the channel of the River Mûshid\tLegolas is to the north within the channel of the River Mûshid that runs through Urash Dâr. Mithrandir has sent much of your travelling company along the river to the north, where he believes the Thardúth dwell. He asked you to speak with them during the approach.\n6\tMeet up with the rest of your travelling party to the distant north-east outside Utug-bûr\tMost of your travelling party has arrived at the approach to Utug-bûr, to the distant north-east in Urash Dâr.\n7\tTalk to Mithrandir outside Utug-bûr\tMithrandir is outside Utug-bûr, in the north-eastern reaches of Urash Dâr.\n8\tTalk to Silirtas outside Utug-bûr\tSilirtas is outside Utug-bûr, in north-east Urash Dâr.\n9\tTalk to Corudan outside Utug-bûr\tCorudan is outside Utug-bûr, in north-east Urash Dâr.\n10\tTalk to Corudan outside Utug-bûr and stand against Azagath\tCorudan is outside Utug-bûr, in north-east Urash Dâr.\n11\tTalk to Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir\tMithrandir commands your allied forces during the Dagor Carlanthir, the Battle of the Red Waterfall.\n",
[2931]="700539F3\n1\tTravel to Fennas Gost on the outskirts of Imlad Morgul\tFennas Gost, the Dread Door on the outskirts of Gorgoroth, provides access to Imlad Morgul.\n2\tTalk to the injured Ranger at Fennas Gost\tAn injured Ranger at Fennas Gost has called to you, hoping to prevent you from suffering as he has.\n3\tFind Echad Uial in Imlad Morgul\tEchad Uial is west of Fennas Gost, in Imlad Morgul.\n4\tTalk to Beregond at Echad Uial\tBeregond is at Echad Uial in Imlad Morgul.\n5\tLook at Minas Morgul when you emerge from the trees along the road, by the stone pillar\030Follow the road west of Echad Uial, until you emerge from the trees near a stone pillar\030Look at the environs from the bridge of Gúliant\030Find the bridge of Gúliant over the Morgulduin, west along the road\030Defeat foes throughout Rath Dúath (total: 10)\tBeregond asked you to defeat foes throughout Rath Dúath, and to scout the terrain by looking at several important landmarks within Imlad Morgul.\n6\tTalk to Faramir at the Bridge of Gúliant\tFaramir, Prince of Ithilien, can be found near the Bridge of Gúliant in Imlad Morgul.\n",
[2932]="7006B70F\n1\tThe Dagor Carlanthir rages in Urash Dâr.\t\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir\tMithrandir commands the allied forces on the south-western bank of the river during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n3\tThe Dagor Carlanthir rages in Urash Dâr.\t\n4\tTalk to Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir\tMithrandir struggles against a distant opponent during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n5\tTalk to Corudan during the Dagor Carlanthir\tCorudan stands near Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n6\tTalk to Corudan during the Dagor Carlanthir and help him seal Utug-bûr\tCorudan stands near Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n7\tTalk to Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir\tMithrandir commands the allied forces during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n8\tTalk to Belondor during the Dagor Carlanthir\tBelondor stands near Mithrandir during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n",
[2933]="700539F6\n1\tFind the main entrance to the city of Minas Morgul\030Defeat foes within Minas Morgul (total: 8)\tThe entrance to Minas Morgul is located at the end of the road south of the Bridge of Gúliant. Faramir asked you to do battle with the foes you find in the Dead City.\n2\tClimb the ramp between the second and third tiers of Minas Morgul, north-west of the Song-house of Lindalírë\tPassage between the second and third tiers of Minas Morgul can be found north-west of the Song-house of Lindalírë.\n3\tTalk to Nâlunitir on the ramp between the second and third tiers of the city, north-west of the Song-house of Lindalírë\tYou found a mortally-wounded Morgul cultist on the ramp between the second and third tiers of Minas Morgul, north-west of the Song-house of Lindalírë.\n4\tReturn to Echad Uial and find Faramir\tFaramir intended to return to Echad Uial. You should find him there and tell him what you learned from the dying Morgul cultist.\n5\tTalk to Faramir at Echad Uial\tFaramir is at Echad Uial, waiting for you to report on what you encountered in the Dead City.\n6\tTalk to Mithrandir at Echad Uial\tMithrandir has made the journey to Echad Uial.\n",
[2934]="7006B712\n1\tGo to the front line of the Dagor Carlanthir, to the north-east\tBelondor wants to send some of his soldiers to fight alongside Sirgon at the front line to the north-east.\n2\tTalk to Elladan during the Dagor Carlanthir\tElladan fights by Sirgon's side during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n3\tTalk to Sirgon during the Dagor Carlanthir\tSirgon has been grievously injured during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n4\tThe Dagor Carlanthir rages all around you\tThe Dagor Carlanthir rages all around you.\n5\tTalk to Corudan in the middle of the river during the Dagor Carlanthir\tCorudan stands in the middle of the river during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n6\tTalk to Corudan and help him place the caches of Narghâk outside Utug-bûr\tCorudan stands in the middle of the river during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n7\tExamine Silirtas during the Dagor Carlanthir\tSilirtas lies outside Utug-bûr during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n8\tTalk to Corudan outside Utug-bûr during the Dagor Carlanthir\tCorudan stands outside Utug-bûr during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n",
[2935]="700539F7\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir in Echad Uial and complete 'Instance: The Sword and the Stonemaiden'\tMithrandir is at Echad Uial, waiting to discuss what else he has learned from the Black Book of Mordor.\n2\tTalk to Faramir at Echad Uial\tFaramir is at Echad Uial.\n3\tTalk to Beregond at Echad Uial\tBeregond is at Echad Uial.\n",
[2936]="70053A0D\n1\tLook for Annoth by the tent north-west of Beregond in Echad Uial\tBeregond charged Annoth with a number of duties to perform by the tent surrounded with crates in Echad Uial, to the north-west of his position.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras at Echad Uial\tDagoras is in Echad Uial.\n3\tExamine the map on the table to the west in Echad Uial\tDagoras saw Annoth studying the map in Echad Uial, to the west.\n4\tTravel to the location Annoth marked on the map, north-west of Minas Morgul, up in the mountains\tThe location Annoth marked on the map is north-west of Minas Morgul, up in the mountains. That may be where he has gone.\n5\tLook for Annoth further along the rocky path\tAnnoth may have climbed the stairs leading to Cirith Ungol. But when did he pass this way, and did he survive?\n6\tTalk to Annoth among the crags not far from the base of the Winding Stair\tAnnoth is among the rocky crags within sight of the bottom of the Winding Stair.\n7\tSearch for some sign of Ugrukhôr among the crags to the north-east of Annoth\tAnnoth asked you to search for signs of Ugrukhôr up the path to the north-east, among the crags.\n8\tBring the report to Annoth not far from the base of the Winding Stair\tYou found a crumpled parchment in the hand of Ugrukhôr's captain. What secrets lie within? The soldier Annoth will be interested to see the report you found.\n9\tBring the report to Mithrandir at Echad Uial\tYou found a crumpled parchment in the hand of Ugrukhôr's captain. What secrets lie within? Gandalf will be interested to see the report you found. Return to the Wizard at Echad Uial.\n",
[2937]="7006B713\n1\tTalk to Corudan and go with him into the darkness of Utug-bûr\tCorudan stands outside Utug-bûr during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n",
[2938]="70053A0E\n1\tTalk to Faramir at Echad Uial\tFaramir is at his camp of Echad Uial.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in Minas Morgul (total: 6)\030Defeat the Dead in Minas Morgul (total: 6)\030Defeat merrevail in Minas Morgul (total: 6)\030Talk to Mithrendan in the centre of the tier troubled by merrevail, in Minas Morgul\030Talk to Culang on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul\tFoes sworn to many different masters stalk the various levels of Minas Morgul. Faramir asked you to defeat enemies throughout the Dead City and to meet up with the Rangers Mithrendan and Culang on the upper levels.\n3\tInvestigate the entrance to Barad Cúron, the Tower of the Crescent Moon, south of Culang's position\tThe entrance to Barad Cúron is guarded by a watchful presence. Culang warned you to be careful, but if you are to gain access to Gothmog's lair inside the tower you will need to dare the guardians.\n4\tTalk to the watchful presence that bars entrance to Barad Cúron\tA watchful presence stands guard at the entrance to Barad Cúron.\n5\tTalk to Culang on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul\tCulang will be interested to hear what guards the entrance to Barad Cúron.\n6\tTalk to Mithrandir at Echad Uial\tMithrandir is waiting for you to return to Echad Uial with word of what guards the entrance to Barad Cúron.\n",
[2939]="7006B715\n1\tTalk to Belondor at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tBelondor is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n2\tSirgon is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\t\n3\tTalk to Girhâzi at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\030Talk to Rahâzi at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tGirhâzi and Rahâzi are at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n4\tTalk to Rothog at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tRothog is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n5\tHúrshauk waits for you to pat him\tRothog's lion Húrshauk is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n6\tTalk to Khôltekh at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tKhôltekh is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n7\tTalk to Corudan at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tCorudan is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n8\tTalk to Sigileth at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tSigileth is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n9\tTalk to Mithrandir at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr\tMithrandir is at Ilzag Khûl in Urash Dâr.\n10\tReturn to Hármelak in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, in Umbar Baharbêl\tHármelak is in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n11\tTalk to Hármelak in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\tHármelak is in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n12\tTalk to Jaith outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\tJaith stands guard outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja.\n",
[2940]="70053A10\n1\tTalk to Meldir just inside the entrance to Minas Tirith\tThe gossipmonger Meldir is just inside the entrance to Minas Tirith. Mithrandir has sent you to Minas Tirith seeking the assistance of Ayorzén, but first you need to find him.\n2\tFind Ayorzén at the Eagle and Star, in Minas Tirith\tMeldir told you that Ayorzén might be found at the Eagle and Star, a tavern south-west of the entrance to Minas Tirith.\n3\tTalk to Ayorzén the Wily at the Eagle and Star\tAyorzén the Wily is at the Eagle and Star in Minas Tirith.\n4\tPlace the mask of Karazgar on the table in front of Ayorzén\tYou should place the mask of Karazgar on the table in front of Ayorzén, and enlist him to help you.\n5\tTalk to Ayorzén at the Eagle and Star\tAyorzén is at the Eagle and Star in Minas Tirith.\n6\tTalk to Mithrandir at the Eagle and Star\tMithrandir has come to the Eagle and Star.\n7\tInvestigate the mysterious figure in the darkened corner of the tavern\tMithrandir has directed your attention to a darkened corner in the room furthest from the entrance.\n8\tTalk to Aragorn at the Eagle and Star\tAragorn has come to the Eagle and Star to meet with you, wearing a disguise that hides his identity.\n9\tTalk to Aragorn and complete 'Instance: The Warrior Remade'\tAragorn is at the Eagle and Star, and he wishes to tell you the story of Eärnur's last days.\n10\tTalk to Aragorn at the Eagle and Star\tAragorn is at the Eagle and Star.\n",
[2941]="70013706\n1\tTalk to Tulk\tTulk is just inside the Doors of Durin that stand by the still pool where you did battle with the Watcher in the Water. You have been told to speak with Tulk about the dwarves that have entered Moria.\n",
[2942]="7001B5C7\n1\tCollect spell-tomes (total: 10)\030Defeat fell spirits in the Ashenslades (total: 8)\tFell spirits and the sorcerers that draw them forth can be found at Sâd Doldúr and throughout the Ashenslades. Ningloril has asked you to defeat the fell spirits being bound to the service of the students of Gorothúl in the Ashenslades and to deprive the sorcerers of their spell tomes.\n2\tBring spell-tomes to Ningloril to be destroyed\tNingloril is at Thangúlhad, in Gathbúrz. You have defeated fell spirits in the Ashenslades and seized the spell-tomes used by the students of Gorothúl to bind them to their service.\n",
[2943]="70021E92\n1\tFind Wadu's father at Lhanuch and give him the ancient sword\tWadu's father Suvulch can be found somewhere within the Uch-lûth village of Lhanuch. You need to find the father of Wadu and bring him the sad news of his son's death. Additionally, he should be given the ancient sword of the Rohirrim that was taken from Wadu when he was slain.\n2\tFind Wadu's sister Nona at Lhanuch and give her the ancient sword\tWadu's sister Nona can be found somewhere within Lhanuch, the village of the Uch-lûth, in Nan Laeglin. Suvulch has coldly dismissed the death of his son Wadu, calling him a coward. You should bring the news of Wadu's death and the ancient Rohirrim sword to his sister Nona instead.\n",
[2944]="7006F2A8\n1\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tUlishár is in Sul Madásh.\n2\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh\tCúridwan is in Sul Madásh.\n3\tA hush has fallen over Sul Madásh\tA hush has fallen over Sul Madásh.\n4\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tUlishár is in Sul Madásh.\n5\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh is in Sul Madásh.\n6\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh\tCúridwan is in Sul Madásh.\n7\tSing or mourn in your own way\tSing or mourn in your own way.\n8\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tUlishár is in Sul Madásh.\n9\tTalk to Glorfindel in Sul Madásh\tGlorfindel is in Sul Madásh.\n10\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh\tCúridwan is in Sul Madásh.\n11\tTalk to Sigileth in Sul Madásh\tSigileth is in Sul Madásh.\n12\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh is in Sul Madásh.\n",
})
